            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-measurement-crinoid-ossicle-sem-specimen-segmented-solid-calcite-volume-fraction-crinoid-stereom-ossicle-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-measurement-crinoid-ossicle-sem-specimen-segmented-trabecular-lattice-period-a-0-crinoid-stereom-ossicle-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-measurement-gibson-ashby-stretching-tpms-phi-1-vs-bending-foam-phi-2-stiffness-amplification-at-phi-0-50>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-measurement-schwarz-diamond-z-4-tetrahedral-inter-strut-angle-arccos-1-3-in-protoreaster-nodosus>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-measurement-super-threshold-pinch-off-ablation-negative-control-nodal-strut-valence-c-1-35>,
